# armour/shared/pauldron_slab4_l: the large SLAB pauldron on the left shoulder (slab.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# one square hammered plate, hard corners, a row of rivets along its foot (WROUGHT, iron): boxy and heavy.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the slab's top edge, G the middle rivet, N the rivet row's gaps, P the plane.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-slab` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron slab.4
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

